# Test Site

> A small fixture site that exercises every page kind.

## Pages

- [Test Site](https://example.test/): A small fixture site that exercises every page kind.
- [Work](https://example.test/projects/): Every fixture project, grouped by what it is about.
- [Alpha](https://example.test/projects/alpha/): Alpha is the first fixture project and it is featured.
- [Gamma](https://example.test/projects/gamma/): Gamma has no order, so it sorts after the ordered ones.
- [Delta](https://example.test/projects/delta/): Delta sorts first in the slow group despite its title.
- [Beta](https://example.test/projects/beta/): Beta ends the slow group, so its pager only goes back.
- [Notes](https://example.test/notes/): A plain page with a table, an image, a quote and code.
- [Pictures](https://example.test/gallery/): Two fixture photos, so the gallery markup and lightbox are covered.

